 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published. 'Start (7)': Hidden Base (dested Hidden Base / Systems Will Slip Through Your Fingers), 'HB Marker', Rendezvous Point, Heading For The Medical Frigate, Squadron Assignments, Insurrection and Strike Planning. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "'HB Marker' is the face-down planet system the Hidden Base objective places from outside the deck; the post does not name the system, so it is shown as posted (UNKNOWN). 'DBay' (listed after 'Home One  DB' and counted in 'Locations ( 9 )') names no specific docking bay; shown as posted (UNKNOWN).",
  "Posted 'RPoint' dested Rendezvous Point; 'Heading for Frigate' Heading For The Medical Frigate; 'DYoda's Hut' Dagobah: Yoda's Hut; 'Home One  DB' Home One: Docking Bay; 'EPP Han/Leia/Luke' Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol, Leia With Blaster Rifle, Luke With Lightsaber; 'Kal Faln'l C'ndros' Kal'Falnl C'ndros; 'Bantha Droid' WED-9-M1 'Bantha' Droid; 'Tantive' Tantive IV; 'Push' What're You Tryin' To Push On Us?; 'DTF' Draw Their Fire. Wise Advice is the Special Edition Effect in 2000.",
  "The strategy is signed 'D'akturak'; the byline is Mike \"Iceman\" Fitzgerald, credited to the existing page Mike Fitzgerald (which already lists his DeckTech deck Project 86)."
